                <invention-title lang="en">TAILLESS NEEDLELESS VALVE SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A valve for a needleless valve system. The valve includes a body configured to be disposed in the needleless valve system and controlling fluid flow through the needleless valve system and wherein the body is tail-less. The body includes a continuous lop surface, and a compression feature configured to control how the body is compressed to allow fluid flow through the needleless valve system.</p>
